METHODOLOGY:

  Provenance: OEIS-only conjecture-mining sweep, 2026-07-23.
  Pipeline: 4 flash scouts -> 4 consumer deep-miners ->
  6 consumer Mathlib/leandoc vocabulary audits -> advisor
  cross-cut. Solved/refuted items culled (Neder gap-12,
  Cloitre A051293, Kurkov, A000712 Bala, A340518, A115016,
  Guy prime hypothesis).

  Epistemics: every CLAIM is OEIS-sourced via agent relay;
  conjecture attributions were re-checked verbatim by the
  deep miners but NOT re-read by the advisor. Every ROUTE
  is advisor-grade prose (conjecture-level), not a proof.
  Files marked "pin from entry" contain a definitional
  detail that MUST be re-read from `oeis show <seq>`
  before the Lean statement is written.

  File schema (uniform): header block
    seq / claim / status / stmt / proof / module / source
  then sections CLAIM, LEAN (vocabulary status, exact
  Mathlib/project decl pointers), ROUTE (mechanism or
  "none"), EVIDENCE (verification bounds).
  stmt = t-shirt cost to STATE in Lean (S/M/L).
  proof = cost/feasibility to PROVE (S/M/L/hard/open).
  The two are independent axes.


